2 CONT         me a little unclear.  It looks like this -
2 CONT           Martin Aanestad, Pa's brother, married a wife in Sandevar and,
2 CONT         perhaps she was a Waal.  Then the farm was Waal?  Their daughter,
2 CONT         Malina, our cousin, married Karl Hvambaal.  She had died in 1915.  Karl
2 CONT         Hvambaal was 72 in 1928 and Selina describes him as a young looking old
2 CONT         man.  Three of Karl and Malina's children lived on the farm.   Halvor
2 CONT         operated the farm.  Peder worked in a bank near by.  Sophie kept house.
