2 CONT * 11. Johan Bernhard, f. 24/4 1902, Stavanger, elektrikar, ugift.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Born in Røyenberg, Sola, Norge (Norway). Immigrated to the United States from Norway aboard the Mauretania. The ship sailed from Liverpool to New York City, arriving 16 August 1912. Mathilda was going to join her half-brother Pede
2 CONC r in Mason City, Iowa. She met her future husband, Nels Anderson, on board. Her name was changed from Lava Mathilde Olsdatter Fuglestad to (Lava) Mathilda Anderson.
