1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Lillian Irene Leen Sele
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth:  Apr. 5, 1913  Death:  Nov. 3, 1997 
2 CONT
2 CONT Lillian Sele, 84, died Monday, November 3, 1997 at the Karlstad Memorial Nursing Center.
2 CONT
2 CONT Funeral Services were held at 10 a.m. Friday, November 7 at Zion Lutheran Church in Lake Bronson with Pastors Cordell and Mary Carol Strug officiating. Interment was at Riverside Church Cemetery in Lake Bronson. The Collins Funera
2 CONC l Home of Karlstad was in charge of the arrangements.
2 CONT
2 CONT Lillian Irene Leen was born April 5, 1913 at Erskine the daughter of Olaf and Nettie (Sevalrud) Leen. She grew to womanhood there, graduating from Erskine High School in 1931. The fall after graduation she moved to Bemidji where s
2 CONC he worked in a grocery store. She later returned to Lake Bronson to care for her mother and worked at grocery stores in both Hallock and Lake Bronson.
2 CONT
2 CONT On January 1, 1939 Lillian was united in marriage to Ralph Sele at Lake Bronson. She was an active member of Zion Lutheran Church at Lake Bronson and was active in the Lake Bronson Senior Citizens group. Ralph passed away in 1969 
2 CONC and Lillian continued to make her home at Lake Bronson until April of 1993 when she moved to the Karlstad Memorial Nursing Center.
2 CONT
2 CONT Lillian is survived by four sons, Wayne (Ronae) of Buffalo, Myron (Janice) of Menasha, WI, Leland (Susan) of Crookston and Lee Robert (Patti) of Drayton, ND; one daughter, Mardelle (Curtis) Danielson of Platteville, CO; 12 grandch
2 CONC ildren; five great-grandchildren; two sisters, Edna Skold of Milton-Freewater, OR and Alice Holm of Karlstad; and several nieces, nephews and other relatives.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was preceded in death by her husband; parents; one sister, Myrtle Richardson; and one brother in infancy. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Family links: 
2 CONT  Spouse:
2 CONT   Ralph R Sele (1909 - 1969)*
2 CONT
2 CONT *Point here for explanation
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial: Riverside Cemetery  Lake Bronson Kittson County Minnesota, USA 
2 CONT
2 CONT Created by: ShaneO Record added: Jul 09, 2008 
