1 NOTE {geni:about_me} "CARL F. THORSON
2 CONT
2 CONT Carl F. Thorson, age 75, of Litchville died Monday afternoon, August 28, 1967, at a Valley City hospital. He had been in poor health for some time. Funeral services will be held at 2 p. m. Friday in the First Lutheran Church of Li
2 CONC tchville with Rev. John Almlie officiating.
2 CONT
2 CONT Carl F. Thorson was born December 17, 1891 in Valley City, the son of John and Matilda Thorson. About 1903 he moved with his parents to Litchville where his father was a blacksmith. Later they moved to a farm in LaMoure County. He
2 CONC  retired in 1958 and made his home in Litchville since. He had never married.
2 CONT
2 CONT He is survived by five sisters: Mrs. Gabriel (Nettie) Berntson of Litchville; Mrs. George (Henrietta) Olson of Seattle, WN; Mrs. Samuel (Lillian) Anderson of Eau Claire, WI, Mrs. Richard (Effie) Eilts of Marion and Mrs. Charles (L
2 CONC orraine) McClaflin of Chicago. Ill."
2 CONT
2 CONT Published in The Litchville Bulletin, Litchville, ND, September 1967. Bio by: Myrna (Lindstrom) McGregor
